summary:
  A title kept over a return to live is kept for ever.

history:
  The keep waits for live's first title. A station that sends none would
  wear the last song of the buffer for the rest of the session, so the keep
  ends after fifteen seconds whether live spoke or not.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftLogic.js

find:
      return since >= 0 && since <= SLEEVE_KEEP_MS;

replace:
      return since >= 0;

expect:
  Killed by tst_timeshiftlogic::test_the_kept_sleeve_has_a_deadline_and_needs_a_listener.
  Line-neutral.
